    "regime_notes": "Negative IC is intentional because the signal is a reversal score: lower recent risk-adjusted return, especially with activity confirmation, predicts higher forward return. Negative ICIR passes the absolute benchmark gate. 2020-2023 has no valid observations in retrieved history; 2024-2026, 2027-2029, 2030-2032, and 2033-2035 are consistently negative.",
